                "npc": "Well, me hearty, it's simple. Ye can cross between two platforms by using the traps or obstacles strung across 'em. Try and make your way to the pillar that is indicated by the flashing arrow."
              },
              {
                "npc": "Ye receive tickets for tagging more than one pillar in a row. So ye won't get a ticket from the first pillar but ye will for every platform ye tag in a row after that."
              },
              {
                "npc": "If ye miss a platform ye will miss out on the next ticket so try and get every platform you can! When ye be done, take the tickets to Jackie over there and she'll exchange them for more stuff!"
              },
              {
                "type": "line",
                "speaker": "Parrot",
                "text": "Tag when green light means tickets! Tag when red light means green light!"
              },
              {
                "player": "Thanks!"
